# ============================================================
# Copilot User Layer — directory allowlist
#
# Default policy:
#   Ignore everything in ~/.copilot.
#
# Only curated User Layer directories and documentation are
# synchronized.
# ============================================================

# Ignore everything.
*

# Allow directory traversal.
!*/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Git repository files
# ------------------------------------------------------------

!.gitignore
!.gitattributes

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# User Layer specification
# ------------------------------------------------------------

!COPILOT_USER_LAYER_SPEC.md

# Curated skill maintenance records only (not all docs).
!/docs/skill-adaptations.md
!/docs/skill-validation.md

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Curated User Layer
# ------------------------------------------------------------

!agents/**
!skills/**
!instructions/**
!hooks/**

# Shared research methods (keep later secret exclusions in force).
!/research-guides/**/*.md

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Defense-in-depth: never track common secret material even
# if it appears inside an otherwise allowed directory.
# ------------------------------------------------------------

**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*secret*
**/*token*
**/*credential*

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Temporary / generated artifacts
# ------------------------------------------------------------

**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.bak
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

# OS metadata
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db